OL,3,W"###"###"###T//////,,/-,/-,/-.-.,//////
OL,4,CEx-addict celebrates sobriety by       
OL,5,Cclimbing Kilimanjaro                   
OL,6,GFor Jon Cooper, every day clean and    
OL,7,Gsober is a "miracle", and now he wants 
OL,8,Gto give others the same experience.    
OL,10,FAfter a decade addicted to drugs and   
OL,11,Falcohol, Cooper, from Motcombe,        
OL,12,FDorset, has climbed Mount Kilimanjaro  
OL,13,Fto raise money for the Clouds House    
OL,14,Frehab centre in Wiltshire, which he    
OL,15,Fcredits with saving his life.          
OL,17,FHe hopes the money will give someone   
OL,18,Felse more time in rehab, which he says 
OL,19,Fchanged everything for him.            
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
