OL,4,CPedestrian, 93, struck by van dies in  
OL,5,Chospital                               
OL,6,GA 93-year-old man has died in hospital 
OL,7,Gafter being hit by a van in Reading.   
OL,9,FThames Valley Police said the man was  
OL,10,Fwalking on Beaconsfield Way, at the    
OL,11,Fjunction with Elm Lane, in Reading     
OL,12,Fwhen he was struck by a white Citroen  
OL,13,FRelay van on Friday at about 13:15 GMT.
OL,15,FThe force said its thoughts were with  
OL,16,Fhis family and loved ones and urged    
OL,17,Fanyone who saw what happened and any   
OL,18,Fdrivers in the area who may have       
OL,19,Fcaptured footage on dashcams to come   
OL,20,Fforward.                               
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
