OL,4,CHouse fire causes partial roof collapse
OL,5,GFirefighters have fought a blaze that  
OL,6,Gcaused the roof of a house to          
OL,7,Gpartially collapse.                    
OL,9,FSix fire engines were initially sent   
OL,10,Fto the fire on Athelstan Road in       
OL,11,FBitterne, Southampton, shortly after   
OL,12,F11:00 GMT, with people living nearby   
OL,13,Furged to keep their windows and doors  
OL,14,Fclosed due to the smoke.               
OL,16,FHampshire & Isle of Wight Fire &       
OL,17,FRescue Service said crews had been     
OL,18,Fscaled back, but a road closure would  
OL,19,Fremain in place while firefighters     
OL,20,Fdampen down.                           
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
