OL,4,CUK reservist regiment in overseas Nato 
OL,5,Cexercise                               
OL,6,GArmy reservists from the south of      
OL,7,GEngland have created a fresh chapter   
OL,8,Gof a regiment's military history in    
OL,9,Gthe snow-covered pine forests of       
OL,10,GFinland.                               
OL,12,FOperating in sub-zero temperatures,    
OL,13,Fthe part-time volunteer soldiers have  
OL,14,Fbeen firing anti-aircraft missiles at  
OL,15,Fflying targets in the regiment's first 
OL,16,Foverseas live-firing exercise.         
OL,18,FAbout 100 reservists from 106th        
OL,19,F(Yeomanry) Regiment Royal Artillery    
OL,20,Fhave been taking part in Nato exercise 
OL,21,FMallet Strike 26.                      
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
